    "description": "The KV-cache: why prefill (processing the prompt) feels slow and decode (generating tokens) streams fast. Real systems-level mechanism, not a UI trick. Falsifiability: the cache grows linearly with context, which is why long contexts get expensive.",
    "aspect": "16:9",
    "date": "2026-08-31",
